## Architecture Decisions (Locked)

### Block System
- 10 blocks: Title, Body, Callout, Hero, Image, Gallery, QuickFacts, Quote, ProsCons, Verdict
- Switch-based rendering (refactor to registry only if 20+ blocks)
- Discriminated unions for type safety
- Renderers receive `{ data, style }` - TemplateStyle has ALL design

### Theme System
- Primary + Accent = user-picked (only 2 pickers)
- Secondary = derived from primary (subtle surfaces)
- Background = fixed white
- Status colours = fixed (success/warning/danger/info)
- 6 curated palettes pre-validated

### Template System
- Structural only (name, description, theme, blocks, required/optional/disabled, maxCount)
- Live templates (edit → all posts update)
- `version: 1` in layoutData for future versioning

